> help
Commands
[1] help - List the commands, or explain one
[2] status - Show the Trace, the cycles, the deck and the forecast
[3] map - Show the nodes, their ICE, and where the patrols go
[4] move - Move to a linked node whose ICE is open
[5] breach - Breach the ICE of a linked node with a program
[6] use - Use a utility program: Cloak, Spoof, Ghost, Overclock
[7] loot - Take the loot of the node you are on
[8] end - End the turn: the patrols move and scan, the ambient Trace rises
[9] jackout - Jack out with the loot you took
[10] undo - Take back the turn under way
[11] quit - Leave the run
